{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Dashboard de anomalias e capacity planning para a Aula 3. Detecta spikes de CPU, compara com baseline e investiga o workload cpu-spike. Projeções são didáticas — o lab local não possui histórico de 30 dias.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Anomaly Detection",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Payments CPU Usage Timeline (mCPU)",
      "description": "Uso de CPU por pod no namespace payments. Útil para identificar o spike do workload cpu-spike durante o exercício da Aula 3.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cpu=\"total\",namespace=\"payments\"}[1m])) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU Spike Detector - Payments",
      "description": "Total de CPU do namespace payments com janela de 1 minuto para detecção rápida de anomalias. Spike visível ao executar ./scripts/start-anomaly.sh.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 200 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 500 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cpu=\"total\",namespace=\"payments\"}[1m])) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "payments total",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Workload Analysis",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top CPU Consumers - Lab Namespaces",
      "description": "Top 10 consumidores de CPU nos namespaces do laboratório. Atualização instantânea para snapshot do momento.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "displayMode": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "displayName", "value": "CPU (mCPU)" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "CPU (mCPU)", "desc": true }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (namespace, pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cpu=\"total\",namespace=~\"payments|users|staging\"}[1m])) * 1000)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "CPU (mCPU)",
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "pod": "Pod"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory by Namespace",
      "description": "Memória working set por namespace. Complementa a análise de anomalias — spikes de CPU podem preceder pressão de memória.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "decmbytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=~\"payments|users|staging\"}) / 1024 / 1024",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Pod Health & Capacity",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod Status by Namespace",
      "description": "Contagem de pods por fase (Running, Pending, Failed, etc.) via kube_pod_status_phase. Requer kube-state-metrics.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["last"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, phase) (kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=~\"payments|users|staging\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} - {{phase}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Capacity Headroom - CPU",
      "description": "Compara CPU allocatable do node vs uso total do cluster. Aproximação didática de headroom — em produção use métricas de autoscaler e forecast.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "CPU Allocatable (cores)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "CPU Requests Total (cores)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "CPU Usage Total (cores)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "last"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(kube_node_status_allocatable{resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "CPU Allocatable (cores)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource=\"cpu\",namespace=~\"payments|users|staging\"})",
          "legendFormat": "CPU Requests Total (cores)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{cpu=\"total\",namespace=~\"payments|users|staging\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU Usage Total (cores)",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Investigation Guide",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Capacity Planning Notes",
      "description": "Notas didáticas sobre limitações do laboratório local para capacity planning.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Capacity Planning — Notas Didáticas\n\n### Limitações do laboratório local\n\n- **Sem histórico real de 30 dias** — o Minikube reinicia e não persiste métricas de longo prazo.\n- **Projeções são didáticas** — gráficos de forecast aqui ilustram o *processo*, não previsões reais.\n- **Baseline curta** — use a janela de 1h deste dashboard como \"baseline\" temporária.\n\n### Processo que você deve aprender\n\n1. **Detectar** — identificar desvio (spike, trend, threshold breach)\n2. **Investigar** — correlacionar com deploys, pods, eventos\n3. **Correlacionar** — cruzar métricas (CPU, memória, status, logs)\n4. **Planejar** — decidir: scale up, rightsizing, quota, ou aceitar o risco\n\n> Em produção: CloudWatch, Datadog ou Prometheus com retention de 90+ dias + forecasting (Prophet, linear regression)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "cpu-spike Investigation",
      "description": "Comandos para reproduzir e investigar a anomalia de CPU no laboratório.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Investigação do workload cpu-spike\n\n### Reproduzir a anomalia\n\n```bash\n./scripts/start-anomaly.sh\n```\n\n### Investigar no cluster\n\n```bash\nkubectl top pods -n payments\nkubectl get pods -n payments\nkubectl describe pod -n payments -l app=cpu-spike\n```\n\n### Parar a anomalia\n\n```bash\n./scripts/stop-anomaly.sh\n```\n\n### O que observar neste dashboard\n\n1. **Payments CPU Timeline** — novo pod `cpu-spike` aparece com alto consumo\n2. **CPU Spike Detector** — linha sobe abruptamente\n3. **Top CPU Consumers** — `cpu-spike` domina o ranking\n4. **Pod Status** — verificar se há pods Pending ou Failed\n\n> Use o prompt da **Aula 3** para gerar análise de anomalia com IA."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
